# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What is deliberately NOT in this repository
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo is public. Research content stays on the cluster at
# /home/lilic/yunyi/ and is not mirrored here.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The three working trees are their own git repositories, nested inside this
# one. They are ignored here on purpose.
#
# Without this, `git add -A` would not recurse into them -- it would record
# each as a bare gitlink, a submodule entry with no .gitmodules. GitHub renders
# that as a grey row you cannot open, and a clone gets three empty directories.
#
# Each tree pushes to its own remote; this repository holds only the layout.
# See README.md for where each one lives.
complexa-post/
RFD4-Proteina/
docs/
baselines/

# Third-party PDFs. Redistributing them from a public repo is a copyright
# question we are not taking on.
*.pdf

# Model weights. Available from their own upstreams, and anything committed
# here stays in history forever.
**/_model_weights/
**/ckpts/
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth

# Generated artifacts, regenerable from the scripts that produced them.
**/analysis/
**/evaluation_results/
**/designs/
**/rollout/
**/pools/

# Symlinks into the cluster's /grogu mount; dangling anywhere else.
complexa-post/inference
complexa-post/evaluation_results

# Python / tooling
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
